{"id": "3327526", "name": "אינטגרל כפול – החלפה לא לינארית: סכום ויחס", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "easytype", "params": ["v0"], "body": "if integerp(v0) then is(abs(v0)<10000) else is(abs(num(v0))<1000 and denom(v0)<1000)"}, {"name": "nicenum", "params": ["v0"], "body": "if ratnump(v0) then easytype(v0) else false"}, {"name": "gof", "params": ["cs", "kd", "m0", "k0"], "body": "if cs=0 then (if kd=0 then u^(m0+1)*exp(k0*v)/2 else u^(m0+1)*(1+v^2)/2) else (if kd=0 then u^(m0-1) else u^(m0-1)*exp(k0*v))"}, {"name": "coefof", "params": ["cs", "kd", "m0", "k0", "u1", "u2", "w1", "w2"], "body": "block([V0],V0:radcan(integrate(integrate(gof(cs,kd,m0,k0),v,w1,w2),u,u1,u2)),if (cs=0 and kd=0) or (cs=1 and kd=1) then radcan(V0/(exp(k0*w2)-exp(k0*w1))) else V0)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהי התחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle D\\)</span> המוגדר על ידי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}\\le {{CT:1}}\\le {{CT:2}},\\qquad {{CT:3}}\\le {{CT:4}}\\le {{CT:5}}\\)</p><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\iint_D {{CT:6}}\\,dx\\,dy\\)</p><p>השתמשו בהחלפה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle u={{CT:1}},\\qquad v={{CT:4}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:inline-block\">[[jsxgraph width='420px' height='380px']]\nvar cs = {{CT:7}}, u0 = {{CT:8}}, u1 = {{CT:9}}, v0 = {{CT:10}}, v1 = {{CT:11}};\nfunction isect(a1, b1, c1, a2, b2, c2) { var d = a1 * b2 - a2 * b1; return [(c1 * b2 - c2 * b1) / d, (a1 * c2 - a2 * c1) / d]; }\nfunction pt(u, v) { return cs == 0 ? isect(1, 1, u, 1 - v, -1 - v, 0) : isect(1, 1, u, v, -1, 0); }\nvar C = [pt(u0, v0), pt(u1, v0), pt(u1, v1), pt(u0, v1)];\nvar xs = [], ys = [];\nfor (var i = 0; i != 4; i++) { xs.push(C[i][0]); ys.push(C[i][1]); }\nvar P = '#4b1f6f', B = '#0f6cbf';\nfunction fit(x0, x1, y0, y1) { var s = 1.25 * Math.max((x1 - x0) / 420, (y1 - y0) / 380), cx = (x0 + x1) / 2, cy = (y0 + y1) / 2; return [cx - 210 * s, cy + 190 * s, cx + 210 * s, cy - 190 * s]; }\nvar board = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox: fit(Math.min(0, Math.min.apply(null, xs)), Math.max.apply(null, xs), Math.min(0, Math.min.apply(null, ys)), Math.max.apply(null, ys)), axis: true, showNavigation: false, showCopyright: false, keepaspectratio: true});\nfunction region(xs, ys) { xs.push(xs[0]); ys.push(ys[0]); return board.create('curve', [xs, ys], {strokeColor: P, strokeWidth: 2, fillColor: P, fillOpacity: 0.15, highlight: false}); }\nfunction arc(xs, ys, fx, fy, t0, t1, n) { for (var i = 0; i != n + 1; i++) { var t = t0 + (t1 - t0) * i / n; xs.push(fx(t)); ys.push(fy(t)); } }\nfunction dash(xs, ys) { return board.create('curve', [xs, ys], {strokeColor: B, strokeWidth: 1.5, dash: 2, highlight: false}); }\nregion(xs, ys);\n[[/jsxgraph]]<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.85em;color:#555\">התחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span>.</div></div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>ההעתקה ההפוכה והיעקוביאן</div><p>כתבו את <b>ההעתקה ההפוכה</b>, כלומר את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> כפונקציות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u,v\\)</span>, וחשבו את היעקוביאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span> הדרוש בהחלפת המשתנים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle x(u,v)=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle y(u,v)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle J=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>התחום במשתנים החדשים</div><p>לאחר ההחלפה התחום הוא מלבן. כתבו אותו בצורה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle a\\le u\\le b,\\qquad c\\le v\\le d\\)</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle a=\\) [[input:ans4]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle b=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]] [[validation:ans5]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle c=\\) [[input:ans6]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle d=\\) [[input:ans7]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans6]] [[validation:ans7]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span>חישוב האינטגרל</div><p>השתמשו בהחלפה שמצאתם וביעקוביאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span> וחשבו את האינטגרל.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\) [[input:ans8]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans8]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-root\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: שורש ריבועי – <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(...)</code>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(5*x)</code>. שורש מסדר אחר – כחזקה, עם סוגריים סביב המעריך: את \\(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">(x+1)^(1/3)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מבטאים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y\\)</span> באמצעות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u,v\\)</span>, מחשבים את היעקוביאן, ומעבירים את האינטגרל למלבן במישור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u,v\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההעתקה ההפוכה (סעיף א׳)</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:20}}\"]]<p>מן ההחלפה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x+y=u\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x-y=uv\\)</span>. חיבור וחיסור של שתי המשוואות נותנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2x=u(1+v)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2y=u(1-v)\\)</span>.</p>[[else]]<p>מן ההחלפה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y=vx\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=x+vx=x(1+v)\\)</span>. מכאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x=\\frac{u}{1+v}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y=vx=\\frac{uv}{1+v}\\)</span>.</p>[[/if]]<p>מן ההחלפה מקבלים את ההעתקה ההפוכה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:12}},\\qquad y={{CT:13}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — היעקוביאן (סעיף א׳)</b><br><p>מטריצת הנגזרות החלקיות של ההעתקה ההפוכה ודטרמיננטה שלה:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial(x,y)}{\\partial(u,v)}=\\det{{CT:14}}={{CT:15}} \\]</p><p>באינטגרל מופיע הערך המוחלט של הדטרמיננטה (בתחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u&gt;0\\)</span>). היעקוביאן הדרוש באינטגרל הוא</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle J={{CT:16}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — התחום החדש (סעיף ב׳)</b><br><p>התנאים המגדירים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> הם בדיוק תנאים על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> ועל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>. התחום החדש הוא המלבן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}\\le u\\le{{CT:2}},\\qquad {{CT:3}}\\le v\\le{{CT:5}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — חישוב האינטגרל (סעיף ג׳)</b><br><p>מציבים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x(u,v)\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(u,v)\\)</span> באינטגרנד ומכפילים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span>. לאחר ההחלפה, כולל היעקוביאן, האינטגרנד נעשה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:17}}\\)</p><p>האינטגרל הפנימי לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_{{{CT:3}}}^{{{CT:5}}}{{CT:17}}\\,dv={{CT:18}} \\]</p><p>ואחריו האינטגרל לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_{{{CT:0}}}^{{{CT:2}}}\\int_{{{CT:3}}}^{{{CT:5}}}{{CT:17}}\\,dv\\,du={{CT:19}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div style=\"display: none;\">[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]][[feedback:prt4]][[feedback:prt5]][[feedback:prt6]][[feedback:prt7]][[feedback:prt8]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans7", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans8", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "xuv", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x(u,v)\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x(u,v)\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "yuv", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(u,v)\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(u,v)\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "jac", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt4", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "ulo", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt5", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "uhi", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt5-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt5-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt6", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans6", "tans": "vlo", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt6-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt6-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt7", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans7", "tans": "vhi", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt7-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt7-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt8", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans8", "tans": "val", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt8-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span> — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt8-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span> — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["Jdet", "Jm", "c0", "c1", "case", "fxy", "g", "innerv", "jac", "k", "kind", "m", "nicedraw", "uExpr", "uhi", "ulo", "v0hi", "v0lo", "v1hi", "v1lo", "vExpr", "val", "vhi", "vlo", "xuv", "yuv"], "nvariants": 50}